# Lean root build context for the images built from this repo root
# (verifier/Dockerfile, ocsp-leaf/Dockerfile): everything here is
# reinstalled/recompiled in the image, or unused by the build.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
.git
.github
ca
# …except the one CA file ocsp-leaf/Dockerfile COPYs (KMS signing helper).
# Without this exception that COPY fails: the whole ca/ tree is excluded above.
!ca/_shared/kms.ts
examples
docs
**/__tests__
**/*.md
native

**/.env*
